privacy-delete-title = Delete your account
privacy-delete-lead = Your account, its data, its sessions, your contacts and the gateways you own are deleted from the running system at once and for good. They leave the backups within 12 months at the latest. Central deletes the messages you sent as well, though what others have already stored on their devices may stay there.
